##  How to Run

Clone repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/NITESHSA1/ATP_24EG106A21.git
```

Move into folder:

```bash
cd session3_assignments
```

Run file:

```bash
node Emp_Payroll_Processor.js
```

or

```bash
node app.js
```

